# W3 wind margin and sustain on a pooled tuning set (generated; SYNTHETIC; behaviour calibration only)

Tuning: fleets 40-45 and 20-25 pooled (the fleets W2 used for tuning and for its held-out check). Held-out: fleets 60-65, used by no earlier run, chosen setting only. Rule fixed before running (script docstring): <= 1.0 healthy alarm episode per turbine-year, then most detections, then longest median lead; if none qualifies, the lowest rate.

